{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"beb02e2f038549fabf1d79acda6dfa5f","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"fa27b86ca1618a441baad32a541da14a28b2","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=fa27b86ca1618a441baad32a541da14a28b2","view_num":1250,"pub_timestamp":"1702366221","title":"12월 13일 업데이트 공지(12/13 내용 수정)","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=fa27b86ca1618a441baad32a541da14a28b2","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e존경하는 지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e오래\u0026nbsp;기다려\u0026nbsp;주셔서\u0026nbsp;진심으로\u0026nbsp;감사드립니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검이\u0026nbsp;완료되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함에서\u0026nbsp;확인해\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이번\u0026nbsp;업데이트는\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;클라이언트가\u0026nbsp;업데이트되어\u0026nbsp;스토어에서\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;클라이언트를\u0026nbsp;새로\u0026nbsp;다운로드하셔야만\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;다운로드를\u0026nbsp;위해,\u0026nbsp;디바이스의\u0026nbsp;저장\u0026nbsp;공간은\u0026nbsp;최소\u0026nbsp;5GB\u0026nbsp;이상\u0026nbsp;확보해\u0026nbsp;주시기를\u0026nbsp;권장드립니다.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전의\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;Launcher에서\u0026nbsp;[게임\u0026nbsp;시작]\u0026nbsp;버튼을\u0026nbsp;터치하면\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;클라이언트로\u0026nbsp;업데이트가\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[리소스\u0026nbsp;파일\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;과정에서\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하는\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;리소스\u0026nbsp;다운로드에\u0026nbsp;실패할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있사오니,\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하지\u0026nbsp;말아\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e지휘관님께\u0026nbsp;더욱\u0026nbsp;편안하고\u0026nbsp;즐거운\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;환경을\u0026nbsp;마련해드리기\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠\u0026nbsp;최적화\u0026nbsp;작업\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;버그에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;수정을\u0026nbsp;진행하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e2월\u0026nbsp;14일\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;NEVERLAND\u0026nbsp;storyII\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;이후,\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;SR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[네베]를\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e업데이트\u0026nbsp;주요\u0026nbsp;내용:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e12월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;발생하는\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;버그\u0026nbsp;수정:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Malgun Gothic\u0026quot;\"\u003e특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;방식의\u0026nbsp;공격\u0026nbsp;대미지가\u0026nbsp;비정상적으로\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2)\u0026nbsp;A2\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「완충전\u0026nbsp;공격」의\u0026nbsp;추가\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;2회\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;초기화\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e버그\u0026nbsp;이용으로\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;지휘관님께서\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장에서\u0026nbsp;비정상적으로\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;점수를\u0026nbsp;얻은\u0026nbsp;현상이\u0026nbsp;확인되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;플레이의\u0026nbsp;공정성\u0026nbsp;유지를\u0026nbsp;위해\u0026nbsp;2023년\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;완료\u0026nbsp;시점부터\u0026nbsp;2023년\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;13일\u0026nbsp;11:00:00(UTC+9)까지의\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장\u0026nbsp;점수\u0026nbsp;기록이\u0026nbsp;초기화됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*기타\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠에서도\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e버그를\u0026nbsp;이용\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e하여\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;비정상적으로\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;대미지로\u0026nbsp;인한\u0026nbsp;이익을\u0026nbsp;취득한\u0026nbsp;경우에도\u0026nbsp;이에\u0026nbsp;따른\u0026nbsp;조치를\u0026nbsp;취하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드는\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;14일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;단위로\u0026nbsp;여러개의\u0026nbsp;파티를\u0026nbsp;사용하여\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;도전하고\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;큐브\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;도전\u0026nbsp;난이도에선\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;피해량을\u0026nbsp;보유한\u0026nbsp;기준으로\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;순위를\u0026nbsp;정하고,\u0026nbsp;랭킹에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;프레임,\u0026nbsp;쥬얼을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2023년\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;14일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2023년\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;21일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드는\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버들과\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;보스에\u0026nbsp;도전하세요.\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;칩을\u0026nbsp;모으면\u0026nbsp;풍부한\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2023년\u0026nbsp;12월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;4일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*참여\u0026nbsp;조건:\u0026nbsp;소속\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레벨\u0026nbsp;3\u0026nbsp;달성\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유의\u0026nbsp;사항:\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;레이드\u0026nbsp;시즌\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;탈퇴\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;구성원\u0026nbsp;추방을\u0026nbsp;할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;기타\u0026nbsp;개선사항\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1)\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;상품이\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e감사합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e《승리의\u0026nbsp;여신:\u0026nbsp;니케》\u0026nbsp;운영진\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_ef64c263357226a65e83d57da8db6607dc7fc369-1920x1080-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"12월 13일 업데이트 공지(12/13 내용 수정)","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"존경하는 지휘관님,\n \n오래 기다려 주셔서 진심으로 감사드립니다. 서버 점검이 완료되었습니다. 서버 점검 보상은 게임 내 메일함에서 확인해 주시기 바랍니다. \n \n이번 업데이트는 게임 클라이언트가 업데이트되어 스토어에서 최신 버전 클라이언트를 새로 다운로드하셔야만 게임에 접속하실 수 있습니다. 신규 클라이언트 다운로드를 위해, 디바이스의 저장 공간은 최소 5GB 이상 확보해 주시기를 권장드립니다. PC 버전의 경우, Launcher에서 [게임 시작] 버튼을 터치하면 최신 클라이언트로 업데이트가 진행됩니다.\n[리소스 파일 다운로드 과정에서 게임 앱을 강제 종료하는 경우 클라이언트 리소스 다운로드에 실패할 수 있사오니, 다운로드 중엔 게임 앱을 강제 종료하지 말아 주시기 바랍니다.]\n \n지휘관님께 더욱 편안하고 즐거운 게임 환경을 마련해드리기 위해 콘텐츠 최적화 작업 및 일부 버그에 대한 수정을 진행하였습니다.\n12월 14일 스토리 이벤트 NEVERLAND storyII 오픈 이후, 이","language":"ko","father_content_id":"fa27b86ca1618a441baad32a541da14a28b2","result":0}}